Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: Scale icons and pictures of the control panel applets to the DPI.
 main.cpl, mmsys.cpl and usrmgr.cpl loaded icons and pictures at 16, 32
 or 48 pixels; use the system icon sizes or scale the size to the screen
 DPI. timedate.cpl: scale the dots of the clock dial and widen the
 outline of the hands from 192 DPI. sysdm.cpl: the System Properties logo
 only exists at 96 DPI and sits in a slot laid out in dialog units;
 enlarge it by the DPI scale rounded down, with pixel replication.
Last-Modified: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:29:05 +0300

